# The live medium's packages: archiso's releng list (the install tools, drivers, firmware
# and rescue tools a live Arch has), bromigOS, and what the live desktop and the
# installer need. One per line; iso/build.sh resolves it against Arch's repositories
# and bromigOS's. Every package here, and the whole closure of `bromigos`, is also
# copied into the offline repository on the medium (docs/iso.md).

# --- Arch's live medium (releng)
alsa-utils
amd-ucode
arch-install-scripts
archinstall
b43-fwcutter
base
bcachefs-tools
bind
bolt
brltty
btrfs-progs
clonezilla
cloud-init
cryptsetup
darkhttpd
ddrescue
dhcpcd
diffutils
dmidecode
dmraid
dnsmasq
dosfstools
e2fsprogs
edk2-shell
efibootmgr
espeakup
ethtool
exfatprogs
f2fs-tools
fatresize
foot-terminfo
fsarchiver
ghostty-terminfo
gpart
gpm
gptfdisk
grml-zsh-config
grub
hdparm
hyperv
intel-ucode
irssi
iw
iwd
jfsutils
kitty-terminfo
kmscon-terminfo
ldns
less
lftp
libfido2
libusb-compat
linux
linux-atm
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-marvell
livecd-sounds
lsscsi
lvm2
lynx
